{"id":"f367207d33b1e75f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-omega-consistency.md","title":"Omega Consistency","display":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-omega-consistency","aliases":["89-df-omega-consistency"],"display":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency","depends_on":["[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-omega-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-omega-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}\\)</span> 接口允许的递归可枚举公理化理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf V\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf V\\)</span> 为固定变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WCon}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{WCon}(T)\\)</span> 是元层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B[\\bar n/x]\">\\(B[\\bar n/x]\\)</span> 为避免捕获的数词替换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WCon}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n(\\exists xB)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\neg B[\\bar n/x]\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WCon}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n(\\exists xB)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\neg B[\\bar n/x]\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 187–190；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n元层谓词：不能一方面证明有见证、另一方面逐个否定每个标准数词见证。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性蕴含一致性，逆向不成立；在可靠 PA 下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Bew}[\\bot]\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Bew}[\\bot]\\)</span> 是一致但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 不一致的例子（第二不完全性与逐个证明检查给出两部分）。本定义没有引入全体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 证明树。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WCon}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B[\\bar n/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WCon}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n(\\exists xB)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\neg B[\\bar n/x]\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T))\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Bew}[\\bot]","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5121b107e6141953","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]] → [[89-df-omega-provability]] → [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glb-logic]] → [[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]] → [[89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete]] → [[89-df-glsb-logic]] → [[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["2d52ad4f119b4a14","a257e5b1de6880b7"]}